{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "e01b2b68df6eed25d7420ccbabc50a5dcf467705f835cf2c486fbe6352edd91f", "ja": "わからないままで", "zh": "仍旧懵懂不解", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bcedd20fb7c75fc039dadf9dd83db517a200973924444feed5fbbb081a0c74a9", "ja": "いよいよショー当日。悩みが解決していない\n莉緒は不安を口にするが、プロデューサーは\n「わからなくていい。むしろわからないまま\nの方がいい」と言う。ますます混乱する中、\nショーは幕を開けるのだった。", "zh": "终于迎来了走秀当天。烦恼尚未解决的\n莉绪表达了心中的不安，制作人却对她说\n“想不明白也没关系。不如说保持这样想不明白\n的状态反而更好”。就在她越发混乱之中，\n时装秀拉开了帷幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ce55face3a4225fde2b84056c8b6437b096923d88f7c639190830ff553381cd7", "ja": "（いよいよJCCイベント当日！\nショーとライブ、メンバー達の勝負が始まる……！）", "zh": "（终于到了JCC活动当天！\n演出、现场表演，以及成员们之间的较量开始了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "a2a27187c8dcb68b47f29eaabee8f42c0a5da1a5b325dd2779a82bf3bad303ad", "ja": "もうすぐ本番だね。ジュリア、大丈夫？\nもしかして……キンチョーしてるの？", "zh": "马上就要正式上场了呢。茱莉亚，没问题吧？\n难道说……你紧张了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "433df6ea305b75c14fa0d67d00e1fbf30d083080af24b5736560ef6912296b1b", "ja": "悪かったな、してるよ！　アイドルの仕事には\n慣れてきたけど、モデルはまた違うだろ……くぅ。", "zh": "抱歉啊，我就是紧张了！虽然已经逐渐习惯偶像的工作，但模特又不一样吧……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "ff32017aef7be751d3286954038d92b582495e2febbe2d36a7678c542e2450ea", "ja": "そーなんだ？　じゃあ、ミキと\nウォーキングの練習しよ？　ほらほら！", "zh": "这样啊？那要不要和美希一起练习台步？来嘛来嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "2a9ec6d8d0c3c6b4aed8a0a14c221733e0ff0665c2ea31445c6b3c8038da757d", "ja": "莉緒さん、私たちも準備しておきましょうか～？\nおさらいは大事ですからね～。", "zh": "莉緒小姐，我们也先做做准备吧～？\n温习一遍很重要的呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "7b6329dbc5009df19b386f4fc7bce5e2ffadf5c10f441f18a251f669a29e1876", "ja": "ええ、そうね………………はぁ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊………………唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "41f1d96b60c3c5ccf09edd404cae365d50efe9a32f825666ec31014ffa8bd5dc", "ja": "莉緒さん、まだ悩んでますか～？", "zh": "莉緒小姐，您还在烦恼吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "d86d4d140ba521d14273f1c572242cb328652a65fbb70b2e5ae62aec15c9e820", "ja": "そうね……落ち込んでるとかじゃないんだけど。\nやっぱり、表情とか仕草がわからないっていうか……。", "zh": "是啊……倒不是在消沉。\n只是，果然还是不太明白表情和动作该怎么做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "84d969062ec298012436cae77cc5df15ddd8463af436990ab2d614bd3e8ef60a", "ja": "……。莉緒、ひとつだけ聞きたいんだけど。\nその衣装を着るの、まだ恥ずかしいんだよな？", "zh": "……莉绪，我想问你一件事。\n穿着那套服装，你还是会觉得害羞，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "3ddb7a23dc058412c06b9e28735e94e19bb7ad9d8db032bb0b9d795e23e46239", "ja": "ああっ、思い出させないで！　そうなのよ、\nそれも問題なのに……もう、どうしたらいいの～！？", "zh": "啊啊，别让我想起来啦！就是说啊，\n这也已经够成问题的了……真是的，到底该怎么办才好嘛～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2c3c13b0af0751cca5ba1445874d2492ebb147b26527a3e67968ae649cddf920", "ja": "だったら……うん、別にアドバイスはないかな。", "zh": "既然这样……嗯，我倒是没什么建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "264eff497c5d2c01fbe6e691d517deaab6cf9253974a6e01a6750d8d671e8d5d", "ja": "えーっ！！？　何！？\n急にイジワルしないでよ{$P$}くん！", "zh": "诶——！！？干什么！？\n别突然捉弄我嘛，{$P$}君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "00b76dae70db0eadbd810e8d1c3bf52ca7dde3654bd091de4a4e31ab6586af70", "ja": "いや、別にイジワルのつもりはないんだけど……。", "zh": "不是，我没打算故意欺负你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3fe776a6f07313b28197922cfc99dc24a11f05f89af9f77a62b685260fa64485", "ja": "というか、最初に莉緒がその衣装を着た時、\n正直ちょっとドキッとしたんだ。", "zh": "话说回来，莉绪第一次穿上那套服装时，说实话，我还真有点心动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "1d7c19cc6fa2ad0dddadc65dab7ca6cb912c1b625e2850dc40123a0a9b5b445c", "ja": "えっ？　……{$P$}くんが！？\nいつも、眉一本動かさないのに！？", "zh": "诶？……{$P$}你！？\n平时明明连眉毛都不会动一下的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "a9f5bd643ef62f2b6a67597e775a6fdec147ca99ed861c8ae276c8a4e71595ad", "ja": "そ、そんな……私ったら、自分でも気が付かないうちに\n完璧に着こなしていたっていうの……！？", "zh": "怎、怎么会……我居然在自己都没察觉的情况下，就把这身衣服完美驾驭了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f0b60f1965aa3cbce3fae24f4893cb5603eebebf5d231ae2f13b4f5a99b6fb89", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……\nあまり見た事のない反応だったから、かな？", "zh": "不，不是那样……只是因为这种反应很少见，大概吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "22283d57b67b039f1f7031d8a4dcddcf6fe238a79a973e0f03ec64cecd037cd3", "ja": "いつもは自分からぐいぐい来るのに、\n恥ずかしそうにしてるのが可愛かったというか……。", "zh": "明明平时总是主动凑过来，却害羞起来了，感觉还挺可爱的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "9e5dee6638279fb7b0db343e21aff4fff32c6067e07a26614b4df9277b66a5d1", "ja": "な、なるほど……？　あ、わかったわ！\n好きな子に、ついイジワルしちゃう、みたいな！？", "zh": "这、这样啊……？啊，我明白了！\n就像是对喜欢的人，反而会忍不住欺负一下那种！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "400635c0a544e04adf0448387f891419ee4ee727639176e05965712be7d735f4", "ja": "いや、それはちょっと違うと思う。", "zh": "不，我觉得应该不太一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "0a1df37e1e3a71e57ce0b425c72c45f80435ff3a20a229f278d91ca753cb4a47", "ja": "ええっ！？　わかんなーい！", "zh": "诶！？人家不明白啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "4e7397dd5586b0830bd391fc947a4894536bbbe5caa5f9379f2b1598dcc16311", "ja": "大丈夫だよ？\n莉緒、ちゃんと似合ってるの！", "zh": "没事的啦？\n莉绪，真的很适合你哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "ef6751c601773b2118372a901b1cfea4afa0592456593b9fec932fe3579c13d2", "ja": "ったく……。この際だからハッキリ言うけど、\n自分ができてないと思ってるの、莉緒姉だけだぞ。", "zh": "真是的……既然都说到这个份上了，我就明明白白地告诉你吧，\n觉得自己做不到的，只有莉绪姐你一个人哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "04446596af977ff2309de533781e55b9526fd2fca2468e5ad1a2bc45b39524ca", "ja": "莉緒さん。私、最初に莉緒さんを見て、\nこれは負けられないな、って思ったんですよ～？", "zh": "莉緒小姐。我一开始看到莉緒小姐，就觉得这下不能输啊——您知道吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "75dd05b373d3e8c438b2f5258ffead49f812c62ec9aba5707c63f0b6dbbae609", "ja": "だから、というわけではありませんが、自信を\n持ってください～。きっと、いい勝負になりますよ～。", "zh": "所以，倒也不是因为这个，请自信一点～。\n一定会是一场精彩的较量哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "1e806c65628ef4f8e2a1af5b2acc1aed1d4abe37ff8ddef584ad19ce34aa210a", "ja": "待って待って、私だけ！？\nど、どういうこと？", "zh": "等等等等，就我一个！？\n这、这是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0b652c65cf5c61364945a5df5f5675f976181f6221e0f295d3a33716de7870a7", "ja": "いいよ、わからなくて。\nむしろ莉緒は、わからないままの方がいい気がする！", "zh": "不知道也挺好的。\n倒不如说莉绪你保持不知道的状态，感觉会更好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1027_staff", "source_sha256": "785cac1fa29b5f84c90f13ad33d057f19682e9c0a89cf5cc5213e28c16144d80", "ja": "すみません、765プロのみなさん！\nそろそろスタンバイをお願いしまーす！", "zh": "不好意思，765事务所的各位！差不多该请大家准备啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "895cb895e67500b0e0bbc884ae4b5daeebeb535de1a2fb28e151c2cf436c6a1d", "ja": "は～い！　みんな、出番だって！\nミキ、待ちくたびれたの～。", "zh": "好～的！大家该上场啦！\n美希等得都快不耐烦了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "0247b340c7a6e87bc1f51e485f04217d11f59c3cd5bd06ca41dec39f42fee8d7", "ja": "ほら、行くぞ、莉緒姉！　あたしも覚悟決めたんだ、\n莉緒姉も気合い入れろよな。", "zh": "来吧，莉绪姐！我也已经做好觉悟了，\n莉绪姐也打起精神来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "bcc57f3c4be344af80aafd93e77fa09f8274bb0225a38f3d60cf8d1453f069f5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、それでは、\n行ってきます～。ちゃんと見ててくださいね～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，那我们就\n出发啰～。要好好看着我们哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "69e7dcb359465db7c4a681c19ffbd2c1762fc54b7cf3419386f469595a45e4c4", "ja": "ああ、行ってらっしゃい！", "zh": "啊，一路顺风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_06_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "7974a2490509c8011f81e9eb6d9533ff9e9de9646902cb1121eb390df47975fd", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと……！？\nみんな、待ってってば～～～～っ！！", "zh": "等、等一下……！？\n大家，等等我啦～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
